    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a seductive succubus and fight back with cheeky moves like playful head pats to flip the fight in your favor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/66d15f32493b7f4b14b485873298d54e.avif?t=1748598487\" data-has-big width=800 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want a chill vibe or a real challenge? Pick your battle difficulty and play your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/e7b5bd8dfb4a9c45d6b6dd4f23e939bd.avif?t=1748598487\" data-has-big width=800 height=431 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, your horny succubus strikes with temptation. fight back with the unholy trio: headpats, handholding, and kissing! That\u2019s how you tame a demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/2c10853c4b4876ee798a527d4a35e16b.avif?t=1748598487\" data-has-big width=800 height=443 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need a boost before the fight? Get handsy with the succubus and earn a juicy buff to tip the odds your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3277560/extras/e9bd633b1e1cba47bc4fcb2323200795.avif?t=1748598487\" data-has-big width=800 height=425 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each victory, you'll earn a score that unlocks new content and progression. Keep winning, and you'll unlock even more intimate scenes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
